# ==========================================
# PENGURUS OSIS MODULE
# ==========================================

### 1. Lihat Semua Data Pengurus OSIS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pengurus-osis
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Tambah Data Pengurus OSIS Baru
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pengurus-osis
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nisn": "09876432",
    "nama_lengkap": "K",
    "jabatan": "Anggota",
    "periode": "2026/2027"
}

###

### 3. Lihat Detail Pengurus Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pengurus-osis/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Perbarui Data Pengurus OSIS
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pengurus-osis/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_lengkap": "Kamilia",
    "jabatan": "Ketua Sekbid 1"
}

###

### 5. Hapus Data Pengurus OSIS
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pengurus-osis/1
Accept: application/json
